abstract: >-
  An isolated executable theory POC testing the ESS-MAI v189 separation of a
  copyable C ABI handle from Rust-owned once-consumable authority. It
  reproduces replay and forgery refusal while preserving the negative result
  that direct FFI knowledge persistence remains held without a committed
  constitutional verdict.
